{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 的输入起点是 n×J 的归一化表达矩阵，因此 normalized_expression=present 满足其基本输入形式。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "We start from an n×J matrix of normalized expression measures (e.g., read counts) for n single cells and J genes or features."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 假设细胞已被划分为 K 个簇，cluster_labels=present 与这一算法假设相符。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Slingshot assumes that the n cells have been partitioned into K clusters, potentially corresponding to distinct cellular states."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "降维不是硬性必需条件：Slingshot 原则上可直接用于归一化表达，因此 reduced_dimensions=present 属于推荐而非必需。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Although Slingshot can in principle be applied directly to the normalized expression measures, we strongly recommend a dimensionality reduction step before pseudotemporal reconstruction"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "强烈推荐降维，因为曲线拟合使用欧氏距离，在高维空间可能表现不佳；reduced_dimensions=present 已满足这一推荐条件。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "as Slingshot’s curve-fitting step uses Euclidean (or related) distances, which can misbehave in high-dimensional spaces (cf. curse of dimensionality)."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "已知末端簇是可选的局部监督，不决定所有谱系数量；你未提供末端簇信息，因此不能据此判断谱系结构。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "Additionally, Slingshot optionally allows the user to provide further supervision in the inference of the lineages by selecting clusters known to represent terminal cell states, imposing a local constraint on the MST algorithm."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：论文版本要求用户指定初始簇或根节点，但这是版本特定的说明，不能推断所有软件版本都必须显式提供 root 参数。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "Slingshot requires the user to identify the initial cluster or root node."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：包描述中“在降维和聚类之后作为分析流程组件”只是流程定位，不代表精确的通用硬性输入门槛。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "serve as a component in an analysis pipeline after dimensionality reduction and clustering."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
